{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/974895-conjunctional-effects-and-difficulty","id":974895,"title":"Conjunctional effects and difficulty","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-22T22:45:20-07:00","id":974895,"title":"Conjunctional effects and difficulty","content":"As my players start using more and more complex effects, I'm wondering what people think of conjunctional effects RAW.<br /> <br /> It seems to me that a Matter 4, Life 4 effect should be more difficult than a Matter 4 one... <br /> <br /> So, I'm considering either requiring one additional success for conjunctional effects <br /> or<br /> +1 difficulty<br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12296-gabryl","name":"Gabryl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T23:59:53-07:00","id":974916,"title":"","content":"Mh, I think conjunctional effects are fine as they are, RAW.<br /> It's the bread and butter of any creativity when it comes to True Magick, and an effect's required successes are already based on the magnitude of the feat, which matches the power of an effect much more than any conjunctional combinations - a firestorm made by Forces 4 is much more desastrous and potent than, say, using Mind 2 + Forces 1 to share infrared sight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T04:23:08-07:00","id":974984,"title":"","content":"I don't think the difficulty should be higher just because you're using more spheres. That sort of thing discourages from being really inventive.<br /> That being said, more spheres usually mean more moving parts are introduced to any one effect, so it could mean a bump in successes needed compared to just using one sphere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T12:23:56-07:00","id":975164,"title":"","content":"Plus, needing the right Spheres at the right levels is already the cost of doing business with conjunctional Effects. Every Sphere dot is a starting dot, Freebie Point, or Experience Point that must be invested in before it can be included in anything.<br /> <br /> Moreover, some Effects might require conjunctional Spheres, but be comparable in scope as another Effect that requires only a single Sphere. This, of course, being the nature of the Sphere system, which emphasizes certain powers over others. Would it be fair to the PC whose magickal specialty is something that requires a lot of conjunctional Effects, if they had a greater difficulty imposed just for that reason? They are already disadvantaged by needing to pay for more Spheres.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T13:14:25-07:00","id":975191,"title":"","content":"If you want to increase the inherent hardness of a task, the default &quot;penalty&quot; in Mage is to increase the base number of successes needed to pull it off. The grander the feat of magic, the more successes you need. A lot of higher Sphere and highly conjunctional effects are going to need a lot of successes. Getting into difficulty modifiers is just going to mess with what those already do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}